Mulai saat ini,

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:46.450
setiap anggota tim

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.410
dengan izin dapat memanggil.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:48.390
Dan ya,

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:49.330
saat seseorang menyadari

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.370
bahwa mereka bisa mengucapkan

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.230
tambah tiga tugas,

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:52.530
